<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classThreadNamer" kindref="compound">ThreadNamer</ref> static class is used to set the names of running threads created with boost::thread or std::thread, or to set the name of the current/calling thread. </para>
</sect1>
